#: ../../getting_started/metadata_pane.rst:4
msgid ":index:`Metadata Pane <user interface; metadata pane>`"
msgstr ":index:`元数据窗格 <user interface; metadata pane>`"

#: ../../getting_started/metadata_pane.rst:6
msgid "When a file is selected in the Cluster Pane, the Metadata Pane will display the differences between the original tags found in the file metadata and the new tags that will be written to the file."
msgstr ""
"在聚类窗格中选择文件时，元数据窗格将显示文件元数据中找到的原始标签与新将要写"
"入文件的标签之间的差异。"

#: ../../getting_started/metadata_pane.rst:8
msgid "When a track is selected in the Album Pane and there is no file matched to the track, the Metadata Pane will display the differences between the original tags found in the metadata retrieved from MusicBrainz and the new tags that will be written to the file."
msgstr ""
"在专辑窗格中选择音轨，并且没有与音轨匹配的文件时，元数据窗格将显示从 "
"MusicBrainz 检索的元数据中找到的原始标签与新将要写入文件的标签之间的差异。"

#: ../../getting_started/metadata_pane.rst:10
msgid "When a file that has been matched to a track is selected in the Album Pane, the Metadata Pane will display the differences between the original tags found in the file and the new tags that will be written to the file."
msgstr ""
"当在专辑视图中选中与音轨匹配的文件时，元数据视图将显示文件中找到的原始标签与"
"新将要写入文件的标签之间的差异。"

#: ../../getting_started/metadata_pane.rst:12
msgid "In all cases, the original metadata is displayed in the middle column, and the new metadata is displayed in the right-hand column."
msgstr "在所有情况下，原始元数据显示在中间列，新元数据显示在右侧列。"

#: ../../getting_started/metadata_pane.rst:28
msgid "Note that selected files can be saved from either the Cluster Pane, or the Album Pane when matched to a track. The tags written will be those associated with the appropriate save location."
msgstr ""
"请注意，选中的文件可以从聚类视图或与音轨匹配的专辑视图中保存。写入的标签将是"
"与适当保存位置关联的标签。"

#: ../../getting_started/metadata_pane.rst:32
msgid "Tag Differences Display"
msgstr "标签差异显示"

#: ../../getting_started/metadata_pane.rst:34
msgid "When there are differences between the original and new metadata tags, Picard will highlight the differences for easy identification of the changes. Additions will be highlighted in green, and deletions will be highlighted in red."
msgstr ""
"当原始和新元数据标签之间存在差异时，Picard 将突出显示这些差异，以便轻松识别更"
"改。添加的内容将突出显示为绿色，删除的内容将突出显示为红色。"

#: ../../getting_started/metadata_pane.rst:36
msgid "In addition, the tag name in the first column will be highlighted in a different color. Modified tags will be highlighted in yellow, added tags will be highlighted in green, and deleted tags will be highlighted in red."
msgstr ""
"此外，第一列中的标签名称将以不同的颜色突出显示。已修改的标签将突出显示为黄色"
"，添加的标签将突出显示为绿色，删除的标签将突出显示为红色。"

#: ../../getting_started/metadata_pane.rst:38
msgid "Note that track time differences at or below the threshold specified in the :doc:`../config/options_matching` option settings will not be indicated as changed, and will not be highlighted."
msgstr ""
"请注意， :doc:`../config/options_matching` 选项设置中指定的阈值或以下的音轨时间"
"差异将不会指示为已更改，也不会突出显示。"

#: ../../getting_started/metadata_pane.rst:42
msgid "Tag Actions"
msgstr "标签操作"

#: ../../getting_started/metadata_pane.rst:44
msgid "A number of actions can be taken with respect to a tag in the Metadata Pane. These include:"
msgstr "可以针对元数据视图中的标签执行一些操作。这些包括："

#: ../../getting_started/metadata_pane.rst:46
msgid "Editing the tag's value"
msgstr "编辑标签的值"

#: ../../getting_started/metadata_pane.rst:47
msgid "Adding the tag to the \"Preserve Tags\" list"
msgstr "将标签添加到 \"保留标签\" 列表"

#: ../../getting_started/metadata_pane.rst:48
msgid "Removing the tag"
msgstr "删除标签"

#: ../../getting_started/metadata_pane.rst:49
msgid "Copying the tag's value to the clipboard"
msgstr "将标签的值复制到剪贴板"

#: ../../getting_started/metadata_pane.rst:50
msgid "Replacing the tag's value by pasting from the clipboard"
msgstr "通过从剪贴板粘贴来替换标签的值"

#: ../../getting_started/metadata_pane.rst:52
msgid "These actions can be accessed from the context menu brought up by right-clicking on a tag."
msgstr "这些操作可以通过右键单击标签弹出的上下文菜单访问。"

#: ../../getting_started/metadata_pane.rst:67
msgid "The context menu also provides actions to add a new tag, and an option to display the changed tags at the top of the list."
msgstr "上下文菜单还提供添加新标签的操作，以及一个在列表顶部显示已更改标签的选项。"

#: ../../getting_started/metadata_pane.rst:71
msgid ":index:`Editing Metadata <user interface; editing metadata>`"
msgstr ":index:`编辑元数据 <user interface; editing metadata>`"

#: ../../getting_started/metadata_pane.rst:73
msgid "To begin editing a tag's value, you can double-click the value to edit it in-place. You can also edit the tag in the tag editor, brought up from the context menu or by pressing :kbd:`Alt+Shift+E` (:kbd:`⌥+⇧+E` on macOS). Note that double-clicking a multi-value tag always opens the tag editor."
msgstr ""
"要开始编辑标签的值，您可以双击该值进行就地编辑。您也可以通过从上下文菜单或按 "
":kbd:`Alt+Shift+E` (:kbd:`⌥+⇧+E` 在 macOS 上) 带出的标签编辑器来编辑标签。请"
"注意，双击多值标签始终会打开标签编辑器。"

#: ../../getting_started/metadata_pane.rst:88
msgid "Note that the tag editor displays multi-value tags as a list of tags, and normal tags as a list with only one item."
msgstr ""
"请注意，标签编辑器将多值标签显示为标签列表，而普通标签显示为只有一个项目的列"
"表。"

#: ../../getting_started/metadata_pane.rst:90
msgid "From the tag editor, you can select which tag to edit from the drop down list at the top of the editor. You can also add a new tag by entering the new tag name in the tag selector."
msgstr ""
"在标签编辑器中，您可以从编辑器顶部的下拉列表中选择要编辑的标签。您还可以通过"
"在标签选择器中输入新标签名称来添加新标签。"

#: ../../getting_started/metadata_pane.rst:92
msgid "Once you have edited a tag, the right-click context menu for that tag shows two additional actions:"
msgstr "编辑标签后，该标签的右键单击上下文菜单显示两个附加操作："

#: ../../getting_started/metadata_pane.rst:94
msgid "Use Original Values: This will reset the tag back to the original value."
msgstr "使用原始值：这将将标签重置为原始值。"

#: ../../getting_started/metadata_pane.rst:95
msgid "Merge Original Values: This will merge the original values into the list of current values, creating a multi-value tag as required."
msgstr "合并原始值：这将将原始值合并到当前值列表中，按要求创建多值标签。"

#: ../../getting_started/metadata_pane.rst:97
msgid "You can edit multiple files or tracks at once by selecting them in the Cluster Pane or Album Pane before performing the edits. The edits will change the values for all selected items to the same value. This should be used with caution because you could end up with unwanted results, such as accidentally setting all track titles to be the same."
msgstr ""
"您可以在执行编辑之前通过在聚类窗格或专辑窗格中选择它们来同时编辑多个文件或音"
"轨。编辑将更改所有选定项目的值，使其具有相同的值。这应该谨慎使用，因为您可能"
"会得到不想要的结果，例如不小心将所有音轨标题设置为相同。"

#: ../../getting_started/metadata_pane.rst:101
msgid ":index:`Copying and Pasting Tags <user interface; copying and pasting tags>`"
msgstr ":index:`复制和粘贴标签 <user interface; copying and pasting tags>`"

#: ../../getting_started/metadata_pane.rst:103
msgid "Tag values can be copied to the clipboard and pasted, either into another tag or into other files or tracks. The behavior depends on how much you have selected. The :guilabel:`Copy` and :guilabel:`Paste` actions are available from the context menu, and can also be performed using the standard :kbd:`Ctrl+C` and :kbd:`Ctrl+V` keyboard shortcuts (:kbd:`⌘+C` and :kbd:`⌘+V` on macOS)."
msgstr ""
"标签值可以复制到剪贴板并粘贴，可以粘贴到另一个标签或其他文件或音轨中。行为取"
"决于您选择的内容。上下文菜单提供 :guilabel:`Copy` 和 :guilabel:`Paste` 操作，"
"也可以使用标准的 :kbd:`Ctrl+C` 和 :kbd:`Ctrl+V` 键盘快捷键（:kbd:`⌘+C` 和 "
":kbd:`⌘+V` 在 macOS 上）。"

#: ../../getting_started/metadata_pane.rst:106
msgid "Copying"
msgstr "复制"

#: ../../getting_started/metadata_pane.rst:108
msgid "When a single cell is selected, its value is copied to the clipboard as plain text. Copying a cell in the first column copies the tag name, while copying a cell in the original or new value column copies that value. The individual values of a multi-value tag are joined together with a semicolon and a space."
msgstr ""
"当选择单个单元格时，其值作为纯文本复制到剪贴板。复制第一列中的单元格会复制标"
"签名称，而复制原始值或新值列中的单元格会复制该值。多值标签的各个值用分号和空"
"格连接在一起。"

#: ../../getting_started/metadata_pane.rst:110
msgid "When more than one cell is selected, the selected tags and their values are copied as a set. Picard places two representations on the clipboard at the same time. One is an internal representation that is used when pasting back into Picard. The other is a tab-separated representation, with one line per tag containing the tag name, the original value and the new value, that can be pasted into a spreadsheet or a text editor."
msgstr ""
"当选择多个单元格时，选定的标签及其值作为一组复制。Picard 同时在剪贴板上放置两"
"个表示。一个是内部表示，用于粘贴回 Picard 时使用。另一个是制表符分隔表示，每"
"个标签一行，包含标签名称、原始值和新值，可以粘贴到电子表格或文本编辑器中。"

#: ../../getting_started/metadata_pane.rst:113
msgid "Pasting"
msgstr "粘贴"

#: ../../getting_started/metadata_pane.rst:115
msgid "When the clipboard contains plain text, pasting replaces the value of the currently selected cell in the new value column. Multiple values can be pasted by separating them with a semicolon and a space."
msgstr ""
"当剪贴板包含纯文本时，粘贴将替换新值列中当前选中单元格的值。多个值可以通过分"
"号和空格分隔进行粘贴。"

#: ../../getting_started/metadata_pane.rst:117
msgid "When the clipboard contains a set of tags that was copied from Picard, pasting applies all of those tags to the currently selected files or tracks at once. The existing values of those tags are replaced, and any tags that were removed in the copied selection are also removed from the selected files or tracks."
msgstr ""
"当剪贴板包含从 Picard 复制的一组标签时，粘贴将一次性将所有这些标签应用于当前"
"选中的文件或音轨。这些标签的现有值将被替换，并且在复制选择中删除的任何标签也"
"将从选中的文件或音轨中删除。"

#: ../../getting_started/metadata_pane.rst:119
msgid "Note that read-only tags, such as the track length, cannot be pasted into and will be skipped. If the clipboard does not contain any data that Picard can use, a message will be shown in the status bar."
msgstr ""
"请注意，只读标签，如音轨长度，不能被粘贴，并且将被跳过。如果剪贴板不包含 "
"Picard 可以使用的数据，状态栏将显示一条消息。"

#: ../../getting_started/metadata_pane.rst:121
msgid "Note that pasting a set of tags takes effect immediately and can change many tags across all of the selected files or tracks. Because Picard does not currently provide an undo function, this should be used with caution to avoid unintended changes, such as accidentally overwriting the tags of several files at once."
msgstr ""
"请注意，粘贴一组标签将立即生效，并且可以更改所有选中文件或音轨中的许多标签。"
"由于 Picard 目前不提供撤销功能，因此应谨慎使用，以避免意外更改，例如一次性意"
"外覆盖几个文件的标签。"
